Ajab Zehra Ke Bete Ki Ghareebi Ka Zamana Hai<br>
kamar Tooti Hai Aur Abbas Ka Lasha Uthana Hai<br>
<br>
1. Tarayi Par Jise Loota Hai Milkar Shaam Walo'n Ne<br>
<br>
ali-e-murtaza Ke Daman-e-dil Ka Khazana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Layee'n Kehte The Abbas-e-jari Ko Qatl Kardalo<br>
<br>
agar Is Aalam-e-ghurbath Me Sarwar Ko Rulana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Wafa Ghazi Ki Kehti Thi Pharere Ka Lahu Pocho<br>
<br>
alam Ko Bibiyon Ke Darmiya'n Khaime Me Jana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Kaha Shabbir Ne Amma Sambhalo Haath Ghazi Ke<br>
<br>
inhe Bali Sakina Ki Nigaho'n Se Chupana Ha<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Ridaye'n Roke Kehti Thi Na Jao Janib-e-dariya<br>
<br>
tumhe Toh Zainab-o-kulsoom Ka Parda Bachana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Huva Hai Imteha'n Kab Khatm Ghazi Ke Kate Sar Ka<br>
<br>
abhi Toh Berida Behno'n Ko Lekar Shaam Jana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Ajal Akber Ke Lashe Par Yeh Kehkar Bain Karti Thi<br>
<br>
jigar Hai Noujawani Ka Magar Naiza Purana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Yeh Kehkar Dasht Me Sheh Turbat-e-asghar Banate Hai<br>
<br>
mujhe Aye Zulfeqar Ab Sabr Tera Aazmana Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
9. Bilal-e-kazmi Ta'zindagi Abbas Ke Gham Me<br>
<br>
yunhi Likh Likh Ke Masoomeen Ko Nouhay Sunana Hai